---
description: UI files use design tokens and RTL logical properties only
globs: ["src/**/ui/**", "**/*.html"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Colors, fonts, spacing, radii come ONLY from `/ui/tokens.css` variables — never a hex value, font name, or pixel size inline.
- Hebrew RTL: `dir="rtl" lang="he"`; logical CSS properties only (`inline-start`/`inline-end`, `margin-inline`, `padding-block`) — never `left`/`right`.
- Wrap ids, times, phone numbers, and dates in `dir="ltr"` spans; format dates with `Intl.DateTimeFormat('he-IL')`.
- Self-contained HTML per screen; no bundler, no component framework, no new runtime UI dependency.
- Touch targets ≥ 44px on tenant screens; 36px controls on the ops board.
